<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Boletim Impressão - PIB São Miguel</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;0,900;1,700&family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap');

        :root {
            --dark: #0d1b2e;
            --gold: #c9a84c;
            --cream: #f5f0e8;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --gray: #444444;
            --light: #e8e2d8;
        }

        @page {
            size: 297mm 210mm;
            margin: 0;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            background-color: #333;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20mm;
            padding: 10mm 0;
            -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
            print-color-adjust: exact;
        }

        .page {
            width: 297mm;
            height: 210mm;
            background: var(--cream);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                background-color: transparent;
                padding: 0;
                gap: 0;
                display: block;
            }

            .page {
                box-shadow: none;
                page-break-after: always;
            }

            .page:last-child {
                page-break-after: auto;
            }
        }

        /* Estilos Capa */
        .p1-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .p1-left {
            width: 48%;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--dark);
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            padding: 15mm;
        }

        .p1-left::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            right: -40px;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 90px;
            height: 55%;
            background: var(--gold);
            border-radius: 80px 0 0 0;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .p1-left::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            right: -20px;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 60px;
            height: 38%;
            background: var(--white);
            border-radius: 60px 0 0 0;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .title-block {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
        }

        .logo-block {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            padding: 10px 0;
        }

        .logo-block img {
            max-width: 65%;
            max-height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .title-block h1 {
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 55pt;
            color: var(--white);
            line-height: 0.9;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .title-block h2 {
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 55pt;
            color: var(--gold);
            line-height: 0.9;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .church-name {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .church-name .line {
            flex: 1;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--gold);
        }

        .church-name span {
            color: var(--white);
            font-size: 9pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .icons-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            z-index: 3;
            position: relative;
        }

        .icon-item {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            padding: 0 8px;
        }

        .icon-item:last-child {
            border-right: none;
        }

        .icon-circle {
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            background: var(--gold);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .icon-circle svg {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            fill: var(--dark);
        }

        .icon-label {
            color: var(--white);
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .icon-sublabel {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
            font-size: 7pt;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: -6px;
        }

        .quote-block {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
        }

        .quote-mark-open,
        .quote-mark-close {
            font-size: 40px;
            color: var(--gold);
            position: absolute;
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
        }

        .quote-mark-open {
            top: 14px;
            left: 10px;
            line-height: 0.5;
        }

        .quote-mark-close {
            bottom: 8px;
            right: 12px;
            line-height: 0;
        }

        .quote-block p {
            color: var(--white);
            font-size: 11pt;
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.5;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .quote-ref {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 9pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }

        .cursive-footer {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 18pt;
            color: var(--gold);
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 12px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3);
            z-index: 3;
            position: relative;
        }

        .p1-right {
            width: 52%;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--cream);
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            padding: 10mm 15mm;
        }

        .section-header-p1 {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            background: var(--dark);
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            width: fit-content;
        }

        .section-header-p1 span {
            color: var(--white);
            font-size: 10pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .aviso-item-p1 {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            padding-bottom: 14px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .aviso-item-p1:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .aviso-icon-p1 {
            width: 35px;
            height: 35px;
            background: var(--gold);
            border-radius: 50%;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .aviso-icon-p1 svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            fill: var(--dark);
        }

        .aviso-text-p1 strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 10pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--dark);
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .aviso-text-p1 p {
            font-size: 9pt;
            color: var(--gray);
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .aviso-text-p1 .whatsapp {
            font-size: 9pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--dark);
            margin-top: 3px;
        }

        .projetos-header {
            background: var(--gold);
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 5px 16px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            width: fit-content;
        }

        .projetos-header span {
            color: var(--dark);
            font-size: 9pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .projeto-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .projeto-box {
            width: 35px;
            height: 35px;
            background: var(--gold);
            border-radius: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .projeto-box svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            fill: var(--dark);
        }

        .projeto-text strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 10pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .projeto-text span {
            font-size: 9pt;
            color: var(--gray);
        }

        .social-bar {
            background: var(--cream);
            padding: 10px 15mm;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 25mm;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: var(--gray);
            font-weight: 600;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            width: calc(100% - 35mm);
        }

        .social-bar span {
            color: var(--dark);
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .footer-bar {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: var(--dark);
            display: flex;
            align-items: stretch;
            height: 25mm;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .footer-contact {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 4mm 5mm 4mm 15mm;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .contact-line {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: var(--white);
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .contact-line svg {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            fill: var(--gold);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .footer-brand {
            background: var(--gold);
            padding: 4mm 5mm;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start;
            width: 35mm;
        }

        .footer-brand .pib {
            font-size: 16pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--dark);
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .footer-brand .sao-miguel {
            font-size: 10pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--dark);
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .footer-brand .tagline {
            font-size: 5pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--dark);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        /* Estilos Conteúdo */
        .p2-wrapper {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            grid-template-rows: 15mm 1fr;
            height: 100%;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .p2-header {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            background: var(--dark);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 15mm;
        }

        .p2-header-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .p2-header-title .boletim {
            font-size: 18pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--white);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .p2-header-title .semanal {
            font-size: 18pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--gold);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .p2-header-date {
            background: var(--gold);
            color: var(--dark);
            font-size: 11pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .p2-body {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            height: calc(210mm - 15mm - 35mm);
        }

        .col {
            padding: 6mm 10mm;
            border-right: 1px solid var(--light);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .col:last-child {
            border-right: none;
        }

        .sec-header-p2 {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: var(--dark);
            color: var(--white);
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            width: fit-content;
        }

        .sec-header-p2.gold {
            background: var(--gold);
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .tema-icons {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 6px;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .tema-icon-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .tema-circle {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            background: var(--gold);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 10pt;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .palavra-pastoral {
            padding: 8px 0;
            color: var(--gray);
            font-size: 8.5pt;
            line-height: 1.5;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .palavra-pastoral strong {
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .atividade-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: stretch;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 4px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--light);
        }

        .atividade-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .dia-badge {
            background: var(--dark);
            color: var(--white);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 4px;
            text-align: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            min-width: 32px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .dia-badge .num {
            font-size: 12pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .dia-badge .dow {
            font-size: 6.5pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--gold);
        }

        .atividade-items {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2px;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .ativ-line {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .ativ-time {
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--gold);
            background: var(--dark);
            border-radius: 3px;
            padding: 1px 4px;
        }

        .ativ-name {
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .lista-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 2px 0;
        }

        .lista-dot {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background: var(--gold);
            border-radius: 50%;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .lista-text {
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: var(--gray);
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .aniv-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 3px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--light);
        }

        .aniv-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .aniv-date {
            background: var(--gold);
            color: var(--dark);
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 2px 4px;
        }

        .aniv-name {
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .cultos-container {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 30mm;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 0;
            background: var(--cream);
            border-top: 2px solid var(--dark);
            padding: 4mm 10mm;
            height: 27mm;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .culto-header {
            background: var(--dark);
            color: var(--white);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .culto-header .title {
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .culto-header .hora {
            margin-left: auto;
            background: var(--gold);
            color: var(--dark);
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1px 6px;
        }

        .culto-item {
            display: flex;
            gap: 4px;
            padding: 1px 0;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .culto-num {
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--gold);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .culto-desc {
            font-size: 7.5pt;
            color: var(--gray);
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .p2-footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: var(--dark);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 10mm;
            height: 8mm;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        }

        .footer-proj {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .proj-icon {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            background: var(--gold);
            border-radius: 3px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .proj-info strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 6.5pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .proj-info span {
            font-size: 6.5pt;
            color: var(--gold);
        }

        .footer-divider {
            width: 1px;
            height: 16px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .footer-social {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 7.5pt;
        }

        .footer-social a {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* --- ESTILO DO BOTÃO FLUTUANTE --- */
        .btn-imprimir {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            background-color: #c9a84c;
            /* O dourado da PIB */
            color: #0d1b2e;
            /* O azul escuro */
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 1000;
            /* Garante que fica por cima de tudo */
            transition: transform 0.2s ease-in-out;
        }

        .btn-imprimir:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            /* Dá um efeitinho ao passar o rato */
        }

        /* --- A MÁGICA: ESCONDER NA IMPRESSÃO --- */
        @media print {

            html,
            body {
                margin: 0 !important;
                padding: 0 !important;
                background-color: white !important;
                width: 100% !important;
                height: 100% !important;
            }

            .no-print {
                display: none !important;
            }

            /* 👇 ADICIONE ESTAS NOVAS REGRAS AQUI 👇 */

            /* 1. Inverte a Capa e a Contra-capa de lado na hora de imprimir */
            .p1-wrapper {
                flex-direction: row-reverse !important;
            }

            /* 2. Muda a curva dourada para o lado da dobra (esquerda) */
            .p1-left::after {
                right: auto !important;
                left: -40px !important;
                border-radius: 0 80px 0 0 !important;
            }

            /* 3. Muda a curva branca para o lado da dobra (esquerda) */
            .p1-left::before {
                right: auto !important;
                left: -20px !important;
                border-radius: 0 60px 0 0 !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="page">
        <div class="p1-wrapper">

            <button class="btn-imprimir no-print" onclick="window.print()">
                🖨️ Imprimir Boletim
            </button>

            <div class="p1-left">
                <div class="title-block">
                    <h1>BOLETIM</h1>
                    <h2>SEMANAL</h2>
                    <div class="church-name">
                        <div class="line"></div><span>PIB SÃO MIGUEL</span>
                        <div class="line"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="logo-block">
                    <img src="/assets/img/logo.png" alt="Logotipo da Igreja">
                </div>

                <div class="icons-row">
                    <div class="icon-item">
                        <div class="icon-circle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path
                                    d="M6 2h12a2 2 0 012 2v16a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V4a2 2 0 012-2zm0 2v16h12V4H6zm2 3h8v2H8V7zm0 4h8v2H8v-2zm0 4h5v2H8v-2z" />
                            </svg></div>
                        <div class="icon-label">Palavra</div>
                        <div class="icon-sublabel">Que transforma</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="icon-item">
                        <div class="icon-circle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path
                                    d="M16 11c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S17.66 5 16 5c-1.66 0-3 1.34-3 3s1.34 3 3 3zm-8 0c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S9.66 5 8 5C6.34 5 5 6.34 5 8s1.34 3 3 3zm0 2c-2.33 0-7 1.17-7 3.5V19h14v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5zm8 0c-.29 0-.62.02-.97.05 1.16.84 1.97 1.97 1.97 3.45V19h6v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5z" />
                            </svg></div>
                        <div class="icon-label">Comunhão</div>
                        <div class="icon-sublabel">Que edifica</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="icon-item">
                        <div class="icon-circle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path
                                    d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5c-1.38 0-2.5-1.12-2.5-2.5s1.12-2.5 2.5-2.5 2.5 1.12 2.5 2.5-1.12 2.5-2.5 2.5z" />
                            </svg></div>
                        <div class="icon-label">Missão</div>
                        <div class="icon-sublabel">Que alcança</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="quote-block">
                    <p>Sejam um, assim como somos um.</p>
